OL,3,GNEWSACalm space garden needs younger
OL,4,Ahelpers to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers at a community garden tucked
OL,7,Faway behind a village high street fear
OL,8,Ffor its future if they cannot attract
OL,9,Fmore young people to get involved.
OL,11,FWhickham Hermitage Garden was a
OL,12,Fthriving Victorian garden attached to
OL,13,Fthe hermitage but it fell into
OL,14,Fdereliction in the 20th Century.
OL,16,FIt was restored and reopened in 2006 by
OL,17,Flocal resident Dave Peacock whose
OL,18,Fambition was to create somewhere for
OL,19,Fthe community to visit. He died in
OL,20,F2021, but volunteers continue to
OL,21,Fmaintain the space.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
